OL,3,GNEWSAWatchdog and critics raise
OL,4,Aconcerns over reliability of NHS
OL,5,Amedical records
OL,6,
OL,7,FConcerns have been raised about the
OL,8,Freliability of the NHS medical records
OL,9,Fsystems used in Scotland.
OL,11,FTheir accuracy has been questioned by
OL,12,Fthe public services watchdog and
OL,13,Fcritics warned there were doubts about
OL,14,Ftheir reliability in safety
OL,15,Finvestigations and court cases.
OL,17,FVictims of disgraced brain surgeon Sam
OL,18,FEljamel have complained of "significant
OL,19,Fgaps" in their records and said they
OL,20,Foften do not reflect the reality of
OL,21,Ftheir care.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,422,420,260,160,0,100
