OL,3,GNEWSAWatchdog and critics raise
OL,4,Aconcerns over reliability of NHS
OL,5,Amedical records
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Scottish government said it took
OL,8,Fthe concerns raised seriously and was
OL,9,Fengaging with health boards over ways
OL,10,Fto improve the reliability of patient
OL,11,Frecords.
